sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as 平台管理员
    participant Controller as MessageAuditController
    participant Service as MessageAuditService
    participant Dao as MessageAuditDao
    participant ContentService as ContentCheckService
    participant MsgService as MessageService

    %% 简历内容审核
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 简历内容审核
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"简历审核"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getFlaggedResumes(pageNum, pageSize)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询flagged=true的简历
    activate Dao
    Note right of Dao: 获取被标记的简历:<br/>- 系统自动检测违规<br/>- 用户举报<br/>- 包含敏感词
    Dao-->>Service: 返回问题简历列表
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>Service: 关联查询用户信息
    Service-->>Controller: 返回问题简历列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示问题简历列表(用户/简历标题/违规标记/操作)
    deactivate Controller

    %% 查看简历详情
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 查看简历详情
    Admin->>Controller: 点击查看简历详情
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getResumeDetailForAudit(resumeId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询简历完整内容
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回简历信息
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>ContentService: 重新检测违规内容
    activate ContentService
    Note right of ContentService: 检测内容:<br/>- 政治敏感词<br/>- 违法信息<br/>- 广告垃圾信息<br/>- 联系方式泄露
    ContentService-->>Service: 返回检测结果(敏感词列表)
    deactivate ContentService
    Service-->>Controller: 返回简历详情+检测结果
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示简历详情页(高亮敏感词)
    deactivate Controller

    %% 处理违规简历
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 处理违规简历
    Admin->>Controller: 处理违规简历
    activate Controller
    alt 清理/下架简历
        Admin->>Controller: 点击"下架/清理简历"
        Controller->>Service: removeResume(resumeId, reason)
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 逻辑删除简历(设置is_deleted=1)
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 删除成功
        Service->>Dao: 记录违规处理日志
        Dao-->>Service: 记录成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>MsgService: 通知用户简历被下架及原因
        activate MsgService
        MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
        deactivate MsgService
        Service-->>Controller: 处理成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"简历已下架"
    else 标记为正常(误报)
        Admin->>Controller: 点击"标记为正常"
        Controller->>Service: markResumeClean(resumeId)
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 清除flagged标记
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service-->>Controller: 标记成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"已标记为正常"
    end
    deactivate Controller

    %% 公告审核
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 公告审核
    Admin->>Controller: 进入"公告审核"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getPendingAnnouncements(pageNum, pageSize)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询status='PENDING'的公告
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回待审核公告列表
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 返回公告列表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示待审核公告列表(标题/创建人/提交时间)

    Admin->>Controller: 点击查看公告详情
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: getAnnouncementDetail(annId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 查询公告完整内容
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 返回公告信息
    deactivate Dao
    Service->>ContentService: 检测公告内容合规性
    activate ContentService
    ContentService-->>Service: 返回检测结果
    deactivate ContentService
    Service-->>Controller: 返回公告详情
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 展示公告详情页
    deactivate Controller

    alt 公告审核通过
        Admin->>Controller: 点击"通过发布"
        activate Controller
        Controller->>Service: approveAnnouncement(annId)
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 更新status='PUBLISHED'<br/>设置发布时间
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service-->>Controller: 通过成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已发布"
        deactivate Controller
    else 公告审核驳回
        Admin->>Controller: 填写驳回原因，点击"驳回"
        activate Controller
        Controller->>Service: rejectAnnouncement(annId, reason)
        activate Service
        Service->>Dao: 更新status='REJECTED'<br/>保存驳回原因
        activate Dao
        Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
        deactivate Dao
        Service->>MsgService: 通知发布人驳回原因
        activate MsgService
        MsgService-->>Service: 通知已发送
        deactivate MsgService
        Service-->>Controller: 驳回成功
        deactivate Service
        Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已驳回"
        deactivate Controller
    end

    %% 公告下架
    Note over Admin, MsgService: 公告下架
    Admin->>Controller: 点击"下架"已发布的公告
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: offlineAnnouncement(annId)
    activate Service
    Service->>Dao: 更新status='OFFLINE'
    activate Dao
    Dao-->>Service: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    Service-->>Controller: 下架成功
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>Admin: 提示"公告已下架"
    deactivate Controller